---

## OPTIONAL TIPS FOR MULTI-POV PROJECTS

- Run this tool across parallel scenes to build dueling perspectives
- Shift from 3rd to 1st to test narrative intimacy
- Use as an intermediate step for anthologies or serials with rotating narrators

